  <str prefix="push_" suffix="aroundtheworld_act3hasstarted" key="push_aroundtheworld_act3hasstarted">記得回來贏得諾貝特·范霍滕和他的飛機！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="aroundtheworld_maxvisitors" key="push_aroundtheworld_maxvisitors">您的城鎮充滿了遊客！該收他們的保護費了！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="aroundtheworld_maxvisitors24h" key="push_aroundtheworld_maxvisitors24h">遊客們都準備好了！記得回來輕觸他們！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="aroundtheworld_newnorberttasks" key="push_aroundtheworld_newnorberttasks">諾貝特準備好開始一場新冒險任務了</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="build_complete" key="push_build_complete">呀呼！新建築！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="build_complete_alt" key="push_build_complete_alt">{0}完成了建造。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_androidsdungeon" key="push_buildingcomplete_androidsdungeon">已建造機器人的地牢漫畫店且漫畫男回來了。「有史以來最．糟．的．末日。」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_bartstreehouse" key="push_buildingcomplete_bartstreehouse">已建造霸子的樹屋且霸子回來了。「我，雖然可能只有我這樣想，想當第一個說…『不是我做的』的人。」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_character1" key="push_buildingcomplete_character1">已建造{0}且{1}回來了。「也該是時候有人把我加進這遊戲裡了！」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_character2" key="push_buildingcomplete_character2">已建造{0}且{1}回來了。「你想我嗎？」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_character3" key="push_buildingcomplete_character3">已建造{0}且{1}回來了。「呼！回來真好。我欠你一次！」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_cletusfarm" key="push_buildingcomplete_cletusfarm">已建造克萊圖斯的農場且克萊圖斯回來了。「回來的第一天我就幫自己弄到一塊能讓我非法佔用的好土地！」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_eatery1" key="push_buildingcomplete_eatery1">{0}現在開始服務顧客。唯一你有權力能少付小費給你的服務生的地方！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_eatery2" key="push_buildingcomplete_eatery2">{0}開始營業了。第一間完全有老鼠擔任員工的餐廳。 </str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_eatery3" key="push_buildingcomplete_eatery3">{0}現在開始營業了。終於有另一個機會能抗議不公平的「不穿衣、不穿鞋、不服務」政策。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_firstchurchofspringfield" key="push_buildingcomplete_firstchurchofspringfield">已建造春田市第一教堂且洛夫喬伊牧師回來了。「記住這個第二次機會是上帝給你的。大概吧。」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_generic1" key="push_buildingcomplete_generic1">{0}已完成建造！看來樹又輸了另一場戰爭。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_generic2" key="push_buildingcomplete_generic2">{0}已經完成了！人們永遠都會把這座歷史遺跡當作一個…地方。 </str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_home1" key="push_buildingcomplete_home1">{0}已完成建造。鑰匙就在…喔不，鑰匙在哪？！？</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_home2" key="push_buildingcomplete_home2">{0}已經完成了！你難道不愛那股新房子的味道嗎？</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_home3" key="push_buildingcomplete_home3">{0}已經完成。只是一棟擁有絕對不會有謀殺案的地下室的尋常房屋。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_krustyburger" key="push_buildingcomplete_krustyburger">已建造庫斯提漢堡店且庫斯提回來了。「沒有速食與企業贊助者你要怎麼重建社會？嘿耶耶耶！」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_krustyland1" key="push_buildingcomplete_krustyland1">{0}已抵達庫斯提樂園！快來唯一一個排隊也是樂趣的一部分的地方！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_krustyland2" key="push_buildingcomplete_krustyland2">{0}已抵達庫斯提樂園！童年最佳創傷的故鄉！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_luigis" key="push_buildingcomplete_luigis">已建造路易吉義式餐廳且路易吉回來了。「速偶！厭倦又老又黃的男人，對種族主義刻版印象的最佳代言人。」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_moestavern" key="push_buildingcomplete_moestavern">已建造阿墨酒吧且阿墨與美枝都回來了。「就說他們都在地獄的邊境吧…一人上天堂，其餘下地獄。」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_policestation" key="push_buildingcomplete_policestation">已建造警察局且維古姆警長回來了。「這個城鎮是沒有法紀的荒地。希望有人很快就會處理那狀況。」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_powerplant" key="push_buildingcomplete_powerplant">冷卻塔已建造完成且伯恩斯先生回來了。「好極了！首先我要重建鎮上的電力，接著我要……找回權力。」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_shop1" key="push_buildingcomplete_shop1">{0}現在開始營業了。終於有賣最終能替你帶來快樂的那樣東西。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_shop2" key="push_buildingcomplete_shop2">{0}現在開張了！我敢說你正因為今天把你的巨大剪綵剪刀忘在家裡而後悔不已。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_shop3" key="push_buildingcomplete_shop3">{0}開張了！好好享受在這裡試用，之後再上網用更便宜的價格購買！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_springfieldelementary" key="push_buildingcomplete_springfieldelementary">已建造春田市小學且斯金納回來了。「啊，春田市小學，我還以為我已逃離這個煉獄。」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_springfieldlibrary" key="push_buildingcomplete_springfieldlibrary">已建造春田市圖書館且馬丁回來了。「你看，是新春田市的黎明。而且看不到任何的惡霸！」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_springfieldpenitentiary" key="push_buildingcomplete_springfieldpenitentiary">已建造春田市監獄且史奈可回來了。「噢對！現在也該從廢墟中離開了，然後再破壞一些東西！」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_springfieldretirementcastle" key="push_buildingcomplete_springfieldretirementcastle">已建造養老院且阿公回來了。「這陣子你們甚至沒人注意到我不見了！護士！」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_townhall" key="push_buildingcomplete_townhall">已建造市政府且昆比市長回來了。「以市長的身分，啊，為你們死老百姓服務是我的榮幸，還可以享受當市長的…所有好處。」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_twocharacter" key="push_buildingcomplete_twocharacter">已建造{0}。{1}和{2}回來了。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_vanhoutenhome" key="push_buildingcomplete_vanhoutenhome">已建造范霍滕的家且范霍滕回來了。「我家空空的而且只有我一個人。這個新世界似乎和舊的一樣糟。」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_williesshack" key="push_buildingcomplete_williesshack">已建造威利的破棚且威利回來了。「啊！這些人，一場災難夷平了城鎮，你們就跑來找工友了！」</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="casino_gamblers" key="push_casino_gamblers">賭徒們想要回家了。在他們身上點一下，強迫他們轉身返回賭場！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="casino_maxgamblers24h" key="push_casino_maxgamblers24h">賭徒們正遠離他們的賭癮。在他們身上點一下，讓他們賭癮再發作。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="casino_playcasinogame" key="push_casino_playcasinogame">你已經好久沒來賭博了，這表示是時候換你贏錢了。趕快來賭一把吧。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="christmas_mysterystocking" key="push_christmas_mysterystocking">使用聖誕老人金幣換取現實物品的最後機會喔！都拿到了嗎？趕快翻翻神秘襪子喔！</str>
